      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of Preiser's disease treated with closing radial wedge osteotomy is reviewed and the therapeutic effect is reported. A good result was obtained in the short term and we believe that this surgical method could become one of the choices for surgical treatment to alleviate pain in Preiser's disease."},
